  "name": "Cityhallen Receipt",
  "description": "This receipt is issued by Cityhallen in Karlskrona, Sweden. The header contains the store branding, transaction date and time, and a notice regarding discounts. The receipt includes an itemized list of grocery purchases with prices in Swedish Krona (SEK), including weighted products priced per kilogram. The financial section records the transaction total together with a detailed MOMS (VAT) breakdown showing taxable amounts at 25% and 12% VAT rates. The payment section confirms settlement using a Maestro card and includes masked card details, terminal information, authorization references, and PIN verification. The footer contains ICA Bonus loyalty information, the qualifying purchase amount, a welcome message, and store opening hours. The overall layout is representative of a Swedish supermarket POS receipt, combining VAT reporting, loyalty-program tracking, EMV card payment, and retail transaction reconciliation within a compact receipt format.",
